{
  "id": "two-person-job",
  "title": "Two-Person Job",
  "titles": [
    "No Exceptions",
    "Two Sets of Hands",
    "Minimum Crew"
  ],
  "description": "A contract that only works with two sets of hands forces a pair of recruits to rely on each other completely.",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "start",
      "text": "A flag goes up on the contract board: two-operative minimum, no exceptions.",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "beat1a",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "A contract broker flags a job explicitly requiring two operatives on-site. No exceptions, no solo runs.",
      "effects": [],
      "position": {
        "x": 300,
        "y": -75
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "beat1b",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "The dispatch board lists a job too dangerous to insure for a single operative.",
      "effects": [],
      "position": {
        "x": 300,
        "y": 75
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bridge1",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "One name goes on the manifest. Command is waiting on the second.",
      "effects": [],
      "position": {
        "x": 600,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "prep",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "Second assignment confirmed. Clearance granted for departure.",
      "effects": [],
      "position": {
        "x": 900,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mission2a",
      "type": "mission",
      "mission": {
        "title": "Two-Hand Extraction",
        "description": "Get the contact off {planetName} before the window closes. This is not a job for one.",
        "difficulty": "STANDARD",
        "tags": [
          "isolated"
        ],
        "missionType": "EXTRACTION_OP"
      },
      "completionText": "Extraction logged. Both operatives accounted for.",
      "position": {
        "x": 1200,
        "y": -75
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mission2b",
      "type": "mission",
      "mission": {
        "title": "Two-Voice Negotiation",
        "description": "Close the deal on {planetName} -- one voice to talk, one pair of eyes to watch the room.",
        "difficulty": "STANDARD",
        "tags": [
          "frontier"
        ],
        "missionType": "DIPLOMACY"
      },
      "completionText": "Terms signed. Neither of them worked alone.",
      "position": {
        "x": 1200,
        "y": 75
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bridge2",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "The job is done. What is left is what it cost, or earned, between the two of them.",
      "effects": [],
      "position": {
        "x": 1500,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "finale-choice",
      "type": "choice",
      "text": "How do they close it out?",
      "choiceOptions": [
        {
          "id": "debrief",
          "label": "Debrief properly -- go over every step together"
        },
        {
          "id": "nod",
          "label": "A quiet nod is enough"
        },
        {
          "id": "business",
          "label": "Say nothing, get back to work"
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 1800,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "payoff-debrief",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "They walk through the whole job again, step by step -- what worked, what almost did not. By the end neither one is holding anything back.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "adjust_relationship",
          "params": {
            "amount": 30
          }
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 2100,
        "y": -150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "end-debrief",
      "type": "end",
      "outcome": "success",
      "text": "Whatever this job cost, it bought something sturdier between the two of them.",
      "position": {
        "x": 2400,
        "y": -150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "payoff-nod",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "No debrief, no words. Just a nod that means the same thing twice.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "adjust_relationship",
          "params": {
            "amount": 20
          }
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 2100,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "end-nod",
      "type": "end",
      "outcome": "success",
      "text": "Nothing was said, and nothing needed to be. The trust is there regardless.",
      "position": {
        "x": 2400,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "payoff-business",
      "type": "story",
      "text": "The manifest gets filed and everyone moves on to the next thing. Still, something small has shifted.",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "adjust_relationship",
          "params": {
            "amount": 12
          }
        }
      ],
      "position": {
        "x": 2100,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "end-business",
      "type": "end",
      "outcome": "success",
      "text": "Not everything needs a moment. The job is done, and it left its mark anyway.",
      "position": {
        "x": 2400,
        "y": 150
      }
    }
  ],
